        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2144, Round Passage Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Round Pocket Door Tubular Lock is a passage set, meaning it neither latches nor locks. That piece that looks like a latch is actually a pop-out edge pull that can be ejected by the press of a finger. The edge pull is used to help retrieve the door from the pocket, giving you something to grasp. The Round Passage Pocket Door Hardware Set comes packaged with a specialty strike plate that is raised slightly in the middle to automatically retract the edge pull so your sliding door will close freely and fully. The Passage Round Tubular Pocket Door Set is available in a wide array of finish options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features a pop out edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket as well as a strike with raised detail to auto-retract the edge pull when closing the door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/dummy-round-pocket-door-set-emtek-2146\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/privacy-round-tubular-pocket-door-set-emtek-2145\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Round Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Maximum Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2144-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262401\"><b>Emtek 2144 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a pop-out edge pull, a passage strike, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
